<urn:kg:ofev:pisection:2f4aa101-da41-4ebc-af80-9fc0275c10e7> a kg:PISection ;
    rdfs:label "OFEV_PI.pdf" ;
    kg:DERIVED_FROM_DOCUMENT <urn:kg:ofev:document:c0db5dd8-583e-47bb-9b75-58402a32791c> ;
    kg:DERIVED_FROM_SECTION <urn:kg:ofev:section:2f4aa101-da41-4ebc-af80-9fc0275c10e7> ;
    kg:graphScope "brand" ;
    kg:page_number 14 ;
    kg:section_id "2f4aa101-da41-4ebc-af80-9fc0275c10e7" ;
    kg:section_title "" ;
    kg:source_document_id "c0db5dd8-583e-47bb-9b75-58402a32791c" ;
    kg:source_document_type "prescribing_information" ;
    kg:source_file_name "OFEV_PI.pdf" ;
    kg:text """Its structural formula is:

<!-- image -->

Nintedanib esylate is a bright yellow powder with an empirical formula of C31H33N5O4·C2H6O3S and a molecular weight of 649.76 g/mol.

OFEV capsules for oral administration are available in 2 dose strengths containing 100 mg or 150 mg of nintedanib (equivalent to 120.40 mg or 180.60 mg nintedanib ethanesulfonate, respectively). The inactive ingredients of OFEV are the following: Fill Material: triglycerides, hard fat, lecithin. Capsule Shell: gelatin, glycerol, titanium dioxide, red ferric oxide, yellow ferric oxide, black ink.""" .

<urn:kg:ofev:pisection:2fb52a50-d6de-4fb8-99cc-e9af0c25d9cb> a kg:PISection ;
    rdfs:label "OFEV_PI.pdf" ;
    kg:DERIVED_FROM_DOCUMENT <urn:kg:ofev:document:c0db5dd8-583e-47bb-9b75-58402a32791c> ;
    kg:DERIVED_FROM_SECTION <urn:kg:ofev:section:2fb52a50-d6de-4fb8-99cc-e9af0c25d9cb> ;
    kg:graphScope "brand" ;
    kg:page_number 3 ;
    kg:section_id "2fb52a50-d6de-4fb8-99cc-e9af0c25d9cb" ;
    kg:section_title "Administration Information" ;
    kg:source_document_id "c0db5dd8-583e-47bb-9b75-58402a32791c" ;
    kg:source_document_type "prescribing_information" ;
    kg:source_file_name "OFEV_PI.pdf" ;
    kg:text """OFEV capsules should be taken with food [see Clinical Pharmacology (12.3)] and swallowed whole with liquid. OFEV capsules should not be chewed because of a bitter taste.

OFEV capsules should not be opened or crushed. If contact with the content of the capsule occurs, wash hands immediately and thoroughly. The effect of chewing or crushing of the capsule on the pharmacokinetics of nintedanib is not known.""" .

<urn:kg:ofev:pisection:305d4f42-378d-478d-aaa3-ac9d5c838b6a> a kg:PISection ;
    rdfs:label "ofev-epar-medicines-overview_en.pdf" ;
    kg:DERIVED_FROM_DOCUMENT <urn:kg:ofev:document:dcf1cfdd-57dc-4936-b9b2-0839e9684cb2> ;
    kg:DERIVED_FROM_SECTION <urn:kg:ofev:section:305d4f42-378d-478d-aaa3-ac9d5c838b6a> ;
    kg:graphScope "brand" ;
    kg:page_number 2 ;
    kg:section_id "305d4f42-378d-478d-aaa3-ac9d5c838b6a" ;
    kg:section_title "What are the risks associated with Ofev?" ;
    kg:source_document_id "dcf1cfdd-57dc-4936-b9b2-0839e9684cb2" ;
    kg:source_document_type "product_information" ;
    kg:source_file_name "ofev-epar-medicines-overview_en.pdf" ;
    kg:text """For the full list of side effects and restrictions with Ofev, see the package leaflet.

The most common side effects with Ofev (which may affect more than 1 in 10 people) include diarrhoea, nausea (feeling sick), vomiting, abdominal pain (belly ache), decreased appetite and raised levels of liver enzymes in the blood (a sign of liver problems). Weight loss (which may affect up to 1 in 10 people) is also common.

Ofev must not be used in patients who are hypersensitive (allergic) to nintedanib, peanut or soya, or any of the other ingredients. Ofev must also not be used in pregnant women.""" .

<urn:kg:ofev:pisection:30e4db24-2953-4c11-a086-d7f9687e383d> a kg:PISection ;
    rdfs:label "OFEV_PI.pdf" ;
