    kg:text """Assets such as typeface, color, and graphics together form our brand identity system, through which we achieve our unique look and feel. All of these elements were created to work together harmoniously and reffect the oFEV ®  brand personality.

HcP ExAMPLE

<!-- image -->""" ;
