    kg:source_hash "ab063d27b2c8650b5d08bb0c3a752399687ba0a00038ef97fb48de9a954fdf8e" ;
    kg:text "No difference in survival was observed in an exploratory analysis of mortality over the whole trial (OFEV: n=10 (3.5%) vs. placebo: n=9 (3.1%)). The analysis of time to death over the whole trial resulted in a HR of 1.16 (95% CI: 0.47, 2.84)." ;
