    kg:text """Typography is another important element of our unbranded identity and a way to communicate our personality.

Helvetica Neue Black Italic and Bold were selected for their strong sense of urgency and for assigning prominence to communication materials. They are also extremely legible in various font sizes.

In applications such as Microsoft ®  Word, Microsoft ®  PowerPoint, and programs with restrictive font sets, use Arial Regular for body text and Arial Bold Italic for headline and subheadline text.

