<urn:kg:ofev:chunk:4186f6f5-9922-4626-a7d4-1795188152a9> a kg:Chunk ;
    rdfs:label "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf" ;
    kg:chunk_id "4186f6f5-9922-4626-a7d4-1795188152a9" ;
    kg:chunk_index 180 ;
    kg:extraction_method "docling" ;
    kg:graphScope "brand" ;
    kg:page_number 77 ;
    kg:section_id "22871919-5050-4ac5-ad6f-3e7ac5323e58" ;
    kg:source_document_id "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2" ;
    kg:source_document_type "brand_book" ;
    kg:source_file_name "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf" ;
    kg:source_hash "f01f8df9d6d766c0224292fbafd2f2019f26b46ff762395351bab78e0d216f52" ;
    kg:text """The clinical trial visual assets for OFEV ® are designed, managed, and used in promotional materials in a recognizable way, as established by our Clinical Trial Visual Identity System. The system helps to unify our materials, creating a consistent, flexible, and ownable visual communication style that is maintained across all channels.

Developing a strong and consistent link between strategic and design elements is essential to the overall success and recognition of study-related communications.""" ;
    kg:token_count 125 .

<urn:kg:ofev:chunk:4197e007-57b5-48db-b01e-72d9ab8d20c8> a kg:Chunk ;
    rdfs:label "OFEV_PI.pdf" ;
    kg:chunk_id "4197e007-57b5-48db-b01e-72d9ab8d20c8" ;
    kg:chunk_index 164 ;
    kg:extraction_method "docling" ;
    kg:graphScope "brand" ;
    kg:page_number 32 ;
    kg:section_id "2201299c-0fe7-4cb4-9e0e-09f8886e8639" ;
    kg:source_document_id "c0db5dd8-583e-47bb-9b75-58402a32791c" ;
    kg:source_document_type "prescribing_information" ;
    kg:source_file_name "OFEV_PI.pdf" ;
    kg:source_hash "889e2c6f657adbe709c56286e5726325abdc2a3bebe53ab6b26735102f04c160" ;
    kg:text """our stomach area.
- increased protein in your urine (proteinuria). OFEV may increase your chances of having protein in your urine. Tell your doctor if you have any signs and symptoms of protein in the urine such as foamy urine, swelling, including in your hands, arms, legs, or feet, or sudden weight gain.

The most common side effects of OFEV are diarrhea, nausea, stomach pain, vomiting, liver problems, decreased appetite, headache, weight loss, and high blood pressure.

These are not all the possible side effects of OFEV. For more information, ask your doctor or pharmacist. Call your doctor for medical advice about side effects. You may report side effects to FDA at 1-800-FDA-1088.""" ;
    kg:token_count 173 .

