    kg:source_hash "71253bd666809651b0b91e1893bb48ea73a8e58191e1b3fb32e3cbe249f8328e" ;
    kg:text """The following pages provide details on use of the clinical trial identity assets for OFEV ® . These assets have been created for use in study-related communications; clear direction is provided for utilizing visual elements.

This section will guide you on how to utilize the unbranded elements, including color palette, typography, templates, and grid systems. Follow these guidelines closely.""" ;
    kg:token_count 98 .

