    kg:text """| For those feeling helpless when facing the devastating diagnosis and unpredictable progression of iPF                                          |
|------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| oFEV ®                                                                                                                                         |
| is a breakthrough therapy that delivers what it promises                                                                                       |
| that slows disease progression in all iPF patient types by reliably reducing FVc decline and exacerbations with a convenient dosing regimen    |
| unlike the complexity and uncertainties of pirfenidone and other therapies                                                                     |
| So that physicians are confident to initiate treatment immediately after diagnosis, enabling patients to live tomorrow like they did yesterday |""" ;
