    kg:text """OFEV ® slows disease progression in a broad range of IPF patient types with a 50% reduction in the decline of lung function OFEV ® reduces adjudicated acute exacerbations by 68%

Side effects can be effectively managed in most patients Only 1 capsule twice a day ensures ease of dosing""" ;
    kg:token_count 71 .

<urn:kg:ofev:chunk:716e2347-b0fb-4e2d-bc11-b4dbeb20a608> a kg:Chunk ;
    rdfs:label "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf" ;
