    kg:text """+

My intelligence, confidence, and the pride i take in my work allow me to regularly achieve success. By becoming the gold standard, i inevitably raise the bar higher for all.

<!-- image -->""" ;
    kg:token_count 48 .

<urn:kg:ofev:chunk:7fac62a8-c282-486d-bba6-0ebc79891255> a kg:Chunk ;
    rdfs:label "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf" ;
    kg:chunk_id "7fac62a8-c282-486d-bba6-0ebc79891255" ;
    kg:chunk_index 125 ;
    kg:extraction_method "docling" ;
    kg:graphScope "brand" ;
    kg:page_number 46 ;
    kg:section_id "2dab5132-5c3e-4be8-b6d9-e55b83b2a72d" ;
    kg:source_document_id "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2" ;
    kg:source_document_type "brand_book" ;
    kg:source_file_name "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf" ;
    kg:source_hash "4888bee174020a894930c5a8133ebc17d38d6c313092c75f8fa818c1200a6cec" ;
    kg:text """The branded message flow is focused on the core selling messages for OFEV ® :

-  OFEV ®  slows disease progression in a broad range of IPF patient types with a 50% reduction in the decline of lung function
- Also including patients with early disease (FVC &gt;90% predicted), no honeycombing on HRCT, and concomitant emphysema
-  Only OFEV ®  reduces adjudicated acute exacerbations by 68%
-  Side effects can be effectively managed in most patients
-  Only 1 capsule, twice daily, ensures ease of dosing

These messages communicate the brand benefit and were the most motivating to the HCP audience during market research.""" ;
    kg:token_count 156 .

<urn:kg:ofev:chunk:812580b2-9cbf-4dc3-9184-024ee5c3a724> a kg:Chunk ;
    rdfs:label "ofev-epar-medicines-overview_en.pdf" ;
    kg:chunk_id "812580b2-9cbf-4dc3-9184-024ee5c3a724" ;
    kg:chunk_index 3 ;
    kg:extraction_method "docling" ;
    kg:graphScope "brand" ;
    kg:page_number 2 ;
    kg:section_id "431a8949-d68d-4026-b6fc-068dc633baa9" ;
    kg:source_document_id "dcf1cfdd-57dc-4936-b9b2-0839e9684cb2" ;
    kg:source_document_type "product_information" ;
    kg:source_file_name "ofev-epar-medicines-overview_en.pdf" ;
    kg:source_hash "4c238f55bf7d17b1f3823924395e6f8040582755cf4656306e371f52a1e85edd" ;
    kg:text "The active substance in Ofev, nintedanib, blocks the activity of some enzymes known as tyrosine kinases. These enzymes are present in certain receptors (such as VEGF, FGF and PDGF receptors) in cells in the lungs, where they activate several processes involved in the generation of fibrous tissue. By blocking these enzymes, nintedanib helps to reduce the formation of fibrous tissue in the lungs, thereby helping to prevent worsening of the disease symptoms." ;
    kg:token_count 115 .

