<urn:kg:ofev:chunk:86506077-f95b-429a-a25d-16c9ad995fde> a kg:Chunk ;
    rdfs:label "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf" ;
    kg:chunk_id "86506077-f95b-429a-a25d-16c9ad995fde" ;
    kg:chunk_index 134 ;
    kg:extraction_method "docling" ;
    kg:graphScope "brand" ;
    kg:page_number 50 ;
    kg:section_id "8c93e117-6515-4c2d-9dcf-2cfcba6f6bd2" ;
    kg:source_document_id "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2" ;
    kg:source_document_type "brand_book" ;
    kg:source_file_name "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf" ;
    kg:source_hash "73e5713cc2c77bf351100ff40dbf8951b308ef537bbb4c787d7332836abd5e75" ;
    kg:text """The OFEV ®  colors were selected to reinforce our brand identity and to differentiate our brand from competitors. They should be used to help maintain brand recognition and impact. The OFEV ®  core brand color is Guardian Blue, and it should be the most prominent color in the palette. In addition, Guardian Blue is the only color that should be used with the line pattern.

The three secondary colors, Inspiring Yellow, Brilliant Gold, and Premium Orange, reflect the colors used in the OFEV ®  gradient. Premium Orange may be used for highlights in applications as well as in typographical call-outs and subheads.

Comfort Gray is included as a neutral tertiary color that helps balance the palette. Comfort Gray can be used in clinical and scientific situations, such as in charts or to represent placebo.

<!-- image -->""" ;
    kg:token_count 206 .

<urn:kg:ofev:chunk:8650f2e1-6dce-4550-9768-7ac8a8bbfe12> a kg:Chunk ;
    rdfs:label "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf" ;
    kg:chunk_id "8650f2e1-6dce-4550-9768-7ac8a8bbfe12" ;
    kg:chunk_index 54 ;
    kg:extraction_method "docling" ;
    kg:graphScope "brand" ;
    kg:page_number 7 ;
    kg:section_id "5662eb42-d69c-4afe-a7e4-0d9a371ccb41" ;
    kg:source_document_id "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2" ;
    kg:source_document_type "brand_book" ;
    kg:source_file_name "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf" ;
    kg:source_hash "b8e8edcb7572e7bde7bf5b89105478d4180dfb615d821a6921c53f6b11a2dda8" ;
    kg:text "Our brand positioning, an internal strategic statement, is the foundation of all branded communications. It shows how we want OFEV ®  to be perceived in the minds of customers, and it is essential that brand positioning be reflected in all our branded marketing efforts." ;
    kg:token_count 68 .

<urn:kg:ofev:chunk:869facea-ccd7-4db7-915f-025d4c66830f> a kg:Chunk ;
    rdfs:label "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf" ;
    kg:chunk_id "869facea-ccd7-4db7-915f-025d4c66830f" ;
    kg:chunk_index 91 ;
    kg:extraction_method "docling" ;
    kg:graphScope "brand" ;
    kg:page_number 25 ;
    kg:section_id "3337f9c8-fb07-47d0-b7ef-51734089cd34" ;
    kg:source_document_id "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2" ;
    kg:source_document_type "brand_book" ;
    kg:source_file_name "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf" ;
    kg:source_hash "765513c17764907d670aea69fe98937d94d859b699f67f819ab9aef192c8d730" ;
    kg:text """A grid provides the underlying structure for the page layout, in addition to maximum flexibility for text, color, and image placement. To ensure consistency throughout all OFEV ®  communications, we have developed a vertical grid and a horizontal grid.

The vertical grid has 8 columns and the horizontal grid has 8 columns. For doublepage spreads, the grid on the left page mirrors that of the right, allowing the inner and outer margins to be maintained while providing flexibility in choice of binding.

<!-- image -->""" ;
    kg:token_count 130 .

<urn:kg:ofev:chunk:87f359cb-264d-48c6-b9a0-18f0dbfa1361> a kg:Chunk ;
    rdfs:label "OFEV_PI.pdf" ;
