    kg:text """and Construction

The OFEV® brandmark consists of 3 this example demonstrates how the brand identity assets create a dynamic layout.

elements: the logotype, the symbol,

and the generic name. The brandmark

is a depiction of wings in motion that

dependably guards over patients.

Because the symbol is moving forward,

it embodies high performance while also

being inspiring. The dark blue and all

caps typeface communicate reliability

and vigilance. Personality traits that

come through   in this brandmark: High

performing, Protective

