    kg:text """Ofev received a marketing authorisation valid throughout the EU on 14 January 2015.

Further information on Ofev can be found on the Agency's website: ema.europa.eu/medicines/human/EPAR/ofev.

This overview was last updated in 01-2025.""" ;
    kg:token_count 59 .

