|                               | N         | Rate of Decline | N                  | Rate of Decline    |                      |
| Region                        |           |                 |                    |                    |                      |
| Asia                          | 71        | -92             | 59                 | -48                | 43 (-37; 124]        |
| Europe                        | 126       | -107            | 139                | -67                | 40 (-17; 96]         |""" ;
