    kg:source_document_type "brand_book" ;
    kg:source_file_name "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf" ;
    kg:source_hash "10619a0b2305c7edd9232fec2563505aa2a9cfe233d2d94541a52d4c89f364a7" ;
    kg:text """Our secondary graphics have been designed to accommodate a variety of layouts and content. The size of the shapes can be scaled up, down, and sideways, adding flexibility to the system while maintaining a consistent look.

Blue should always be the dominant color on the page; the golden supergraphic should be used as a secondary element.

oFEV\\_HorizontAL\\_cMYK.Ai

