    kg:source_document_id "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2" ;
    kg:source_document_type "brand_book" ;
    kg:source_file_name "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf" ;
    kg:source_hash "a1abcded853a6b69e71affe0d1faf7dfb8d09d5f7b1418b4ffb7f42e24bd4fec" ;
    kg:text """The OFEV ®  logo consists of 3 elements: the logotype, the symbol, and the generic name. The symbol depicts wings in motion that dependably guard patients. The symbol is inspiring and representational of high performance because of its forward motion. The use of dark blue and all caps in the logotype communicate reliability and vigilance.

The logo should never be changed in any way to keep the personality consistent worldwide.

uS LoGo

<!-- image -->

Some markets have regulations about the size relationship between the brand and generic names. the united States, for which the oFEV ®  logo is illustrated here, has very speciffc rules regarding that relationship. Please use the assets that have been provided and approved for your region.

<!-- image -->""" ;
    kg:token_count 191 .

