    kg:source_hash "17aebffa3afd8b6067797367f542254744eed3f4d7a5ea0ca31d420a38bee338" ;
    kg:text "Conduct liver function tests (ALT, AST, and bilirubin) prior to initiation of treatment with OFEV, at regular intervals during the first three months of treatment, and periodically thereafter or as clinically indicated. Measure liver tests promptly in patients who report symptoms that may indicate liver injury, including fatigue, anorexia, right upper abdominal discomfort, dark urine or jaundice. Dosage modifications or interruption may be necessary for liver enzyme elevations [see Dosage and Administration (2.1, 2.4)] ." ;
    kg:token_count 132 .

