    kg:text """A secondary graphic is an additional brand element that adds visual distinction and unifies our brand identity across all of our touchpoints.

Our secondary graphic consists of a framing device with a horizontal rectangular tab that holds the headline or any important information that needs to be highlighted.

The holding shape was designed to contain headline and subheadline text. Photography can be placed on the top of the background and/or in the white holding shape, as shown below.

.3'

