    kg:source_file_name "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf" ;
    kg:text """Our brand personality encompasses the memorable persona our brand presents to the world and how we are perceived by our audiences. It includes how our brand looks, acts, and sounds, in human terms.

Together, the following traits define the brand personality of OFEV ® .""" .

