<urn:kg:ofev:section:2dab5132-5c3e-4be8-b6d9-e55b83b2a72d> a kg:Section ;
    rdfs:label "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf" ;
    kg:SECTION_HAS_CHUNK <urn:kg:ofev:chunk:7fac62a8-c282-486d-bba6-0ebc79891255> ;
    kg:extraction_method "docling" ;
    kg:graphScope "brand" ;
    kg:page_number 46 ;
    kg:section_id "2dab5132-5c3e-4be8-b6d9-e55b83b2a72d" ;
    kg:section_title "Message Flow: Branded" ;
    kg:section_type "heading" ;
    kg:source_document_id "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2" ;
    kg:source_document_type "brand_book" ;
    kg:source_file_name "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf" ;
    kg:text """The branded message flow is focused on the core selling messages for OFEV ® :

-  OFEV ®  slows disease progression in a broad range of IPF patient types with a 50% reduction in the decline of lung function
- Also including patients with early disease (FVC &gt;90% predicted), no honeycombing on HRCT, and concomitant emphysema
-  Only OFEV ®  reduces adjudicated acute exacerbations by 68%
-  Side effects can be effectively managed in most patients
-  Only 1 capsule, twice daily, ensures ease of dosing

These messages communicate the brand benefit and were the most motivating to the HCP audience during market research.""" .

