    kg:source_file_name "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf" ;
    kg:text "If you have any questions not answered in these guidelines regarding implementation of the OFEV ®  branding, please reach out-we are here to help." .

<urn:kg:ofev:section:3e128188-269d-498c-a537-2a7ef88f114d> a kg:Section ;
    rdfs:label "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf" ;
    kg:SECTION_HAS_CHUNK <urn:kg:ofev:chunk:9124e088-3eec-4b99-9ca6-fcac4a8e926f> ;
    kg:extraction_method "docling" ;
    kg:graphScope "brand" ;
    kg:page_number 7 ;
    kg:section_id "3e128188-269d-498c-a537-2a7ef88f114d" ;
    kg:section_title "PrEMiSE" ;
    kg:section_type "heading" ;
    kg:source_document_id "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2" ;
    kg:source_document_type "brand_book" ;
    kg:source_file_name "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf" ;
    kg:text """iPF is devastating and unpredictable. Physicians are powerless, and patients live in fear.

the progressive loss of lung function erodes life and results in death by suffocation within 2-3 years of diagnosis.

While most patients experience gradually declining lung function, some also experience precipitous, commonly fatal drops known as acute exacerbations. these come without warning or known cause, and have a direct effect on accelerating disease progression.""" .

