    kg:section_id "88e52763-99f8-45a6-9df0-ecb35ca9323e" ;
    kg:section_title "hcP core campaign 4.0" ;
    kg:section_type "heading" ;
    kg:source_document_id "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2" ;
    kg:source_document_type "brand_book" ;
    kg:source_file_name "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf" ;
    kg:text "The core campaign is the way in which the key brand benefit and the overall brand essence are expressed, both functionally and emotionally. By utilizing the brand's core attributes, the campaign conveys the reason to believe in OFEV ® and communicates the tangible patient benefit to healthcare professionals (HCPs)." .

