    kg:page_number 81 ;
    kg:section_id "309b47f4-7d60-44d0-ac8c-35905423838e" ;
    kg:section_title "Clear Space and Minimum Size" ;
    kg:section_type "heading" ;
    kg:source_document_id "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2" ;
    kg:source_document_type "brand_book" ;
    kg:source_file_name "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf" ;
    kg:text """Clear space is the recommended area of white or an empty space surrounding the INPULSIS ® -1 logo. 100% of the cap height of the logotype is equal to 1x. A minimum clear space of 1x should be maintained around the entire mark at all times.

Minimum size is the smallest size at which our brandmark can be reproduced. The minimum size of the INPULSIS ® -1 brandmark is 7/8' (22mm) in width for print and 125 pixels in width for digital applications. For legibility reasons, the brandmark should never be smaller than that.

<!-- image -->

cLEAr SPAcE

<!-- image -->

MiniMuM SizE

<!-- image -->

Print: 7/8' (22 mm) diGitAL: 125 PixELS""" .

