Revised: XXX 202X""" .

<urn:kg:ofev:section:32bd715c-cf39-431e-9310-aaf5b8a5ece9> a kg:Section ;
    rdfs:label "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf" ;
    kg:SECTION_HAS_CHUNK <urn:kg:ofev:chunk:110d7b54-4801-484e-917f-2e61fe1db01f> ;
    kg:extraction_method "docling" ;
    kg:graphScope "brand" ;
    kg:page_number 39 ;
    kg:section_id "32bd715c-cf39-431e-9310-aaf5b8a5ece9" ;
    kg:section_title "Campaign Visual" ;
    kg:section_type "heading" ;
    kg:source_document_id "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2" ;
    kg:source_document_type "brand_book" ;
    kg:source_file_name "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf" ;
    kg:text """The campaign visual works to clearly communicate the slowing of disease progression with OFEV ® . The campaign shows a declining path, which represents the continuous and irreversible deterioration of lung function in patients with IPF. The path is changed by the intervention of the hand, which lifts and supports the patient as he enjoys time with his grandson, an activity that is common, but not always possible for many patients with IPF. The hand that is changing the path can be interpreted as the HCP, OFEV ® , or Boehringer Ingelheim.

Together, the downward angle of the path, in contrast with the angle of the inset image of the patient, represents the reduction in lung function decline and the slowing of disease progression with OFEV ® .

<!-- image -->

<!-- image -->

<!-- image -->""" .

<urn:kg:ofev:section:32e4de96-8694-4511-bc14-f29466291d9f> a kg:Section ;
    rdfs:label "OFEV_PI.pdf" ;
    kg:SECTION_HAS_CHUNK <urn:kg:ofev:chunk:5ee35fa3-b6c9-435a-960c-256ce9217611> ;
    kg:extraction_method "docling" ;
    kg:graphScope "brand" ;
    kg:page_number 3 ;
    kg:section_id "32e4de96-8694-4511-bc14-f29466291d9f" ;
    kg:section_title "Information for Missed Dose" ;
    kg:section_type "heading" ;
    kg:source_document_id "c0db5dd8-583e-47bb-9b75-58402a32791c" ;
    kg:source_document_type "prescribing_information" ;
    kg:source_file_name "OFEV_PI.pdf" ;
    kg:text "If a dose of OFEV is missed, the next dose should be taken at the next scheduled time. Advise the patient to not make up for a missed dose. Do not exceed the recommended maximum daily dosage of 300 mg." .

<urn:kg:ofev:section:3337f9c8-fb07-47d0-b7ef-51734089cd34> a kg:Section ;
    rdfs:label "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf" ;
    kg:SECTION_HAS_CHUNK <urn:kg:ofev:chunk:869facea-ccd7-4db7-915f-025d4c66830f> ;
    kg:extraction_method "docling" ;
    kg:graphScope "brand" ;
    kg:page_number 25 ;
    kg:section_id "3337f9c8-fb07-47d0-b7ef-51734089cd34" ;
    kg:section_title "Grid System" ;
    kg:section_type "heading" ;
    kg:source_document_id "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2" ;
    kg:source_document_type "brand_book" ;
    kg:source_file_name "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf" ;
    kg:text """A grid provides the underlying structure for the page layout, in addition to maximum flexibility for text, color, and image placement. To ensure consistency throughout all OFEV ®  communications, we have developed a vertical grid and a horizontal grid.

The vertical grid has 8 columns and the horizontal grid has 8 columns. For doublepage spreads, the grid on the left page mirrors that of the right, allowing the inner and outer margins to be maintained while providing flexibility in choice of binding.

<!-- image -->""" .

<urn:kg:ofev:section:334a4964-ba3d-453c-aba8-6208c206a20c> a kg:Section ;
    rdfs:label "ofev-epar-medicines-overview_en.pdf" ;
