    kg:source_file_name "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf" ;
    kg:text """Clinical trial visual identity assets include more than just color and typography. The secondary graphics for the clinical trials provide an ownable and recognizable look-beyond the logo-that can be used on all study-related communications.

<!-- image -->""" .

