    kg:text """Our clinical trial logo consists of 2 elements: the trial name and the symbol. The symbol depicts a hummingbird, representing vigor and energy. The dark blue, all-caps typeface in the trial name communicates innovation and intelligence.

<!-- image -->

triAL nAME""" .

<urn:kg:ofev:section:577c605e-45b9-43ba-a90e-dda0f83b76d3> a kg:Section ;
