    kg:page_number 14 ;
    kg:section_id "872fc0cc-8d81-4568-9f2b-277ffba4e222" ;
    kg:section_title "12.2  Pharmacodynamics" ;
    kg:section_type "heading" ;
    kg:source_document_id "c0db5dd8-583e-47bb-9b75-58402a32791c" ;
    kg:source_document_type "prescribing_information" ;
    kg:source_file_name "OFEV_PI.pdf" ;
    kg:text "" .

<urn:kg:ofev:section:87911271-cc4f-4d91-a555-6f6d772c046d> a kg:Section ;
    rdfs:label "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf" ;
    kg:SECTION_HAS_CHUNK <urn:kg:ofev:chunk:c4bee6d2-48ec-4fae-ba4f-15fea4bc040f>,
        <urn:kg:ofev:chunk:f0ae57b5-78cc-4967-abc4-f3e57482ca9f> ;
    kg:extraction_method "docling" ;
    kg:graphScope "brand" ;
    kg:page_number 2 ;
    kg:section_id "87911271-cc4f-4d91-a555-6f6d772c046d" ;
    kg:section_title "Introduction" ;
    kg:section_type "heading" ;
    kg:source_document_id "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2" ;
    kg:source_document_type "brand_book" ;
    kg:source_file_name "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf" ;
    kg:text """this brand book is a valuable resource that will help you launch an effective brand campaign for oFEV ®  in your region. it provides you with essential guidance on how to build and maintain an identifiable, successful, and consistent global brand.

it is critical to the brand integrity of oFEV ® that these guidelines are closely followed; doing so will ensure that a strong identity is built. As always, please keep in mind that all promotional materials must be reviewed by your local regulatory team for consistency with the local Summary of Product characteristics and Patient information Leaflet and approved by the respective market and prepare for medical, legal, and regulatory review.

Effective global branding establishes a product that is recognized around the world. Key elements, known as brand assets (including brand colors, logo, messages, and promotional concept), build an image that is distinct, repeatable, and translatableregardless of location. The way to achieve high brand recognition is through consistent communication of all branding elements.""" .

<urn:kg:ofev:section:8812673f-987c-43b7-925c-d8682e41f5c2> a kg:Section ;
    rdfs:label "OFEV_PI.pdf" ;
