    kg:source_document_id "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2" ;
    kg:source_document_type "brand_book" ;
    kg:source_file_name "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf" ;
    kg:text """The key elements of the campaign-the visual, headline, tagline, and secondary graphics-are all designed to illustrate the unpredictable and devastating nature of IPF. All the elements complement one another and work synergistically to communicate the urgency of the disease state.

BrocHurE coVEr ExAMPLE

