    kg:section_id "eb34159f-a331-4242-be7d-f06e60c9aec5" ;
    kg:section_title "Logo Color Versions" ;
    kg:section_type "heading" ;
    kg:source_document_id "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2" ;
    kg:source_document_type "brand_book" ;
    kg:source_file_name "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf" ;
    kg:text """The preferred use of the OFEV ® logo is the CMYK version on a white background.

The CMYK and PMS logos are used when printing communication pieces. When printing in black and white, use the grayscale version of the logo. The RGB version of the logo should be used in digital applications, such as interfaces, websites, and PowerPoint presentations.

